MiB / ctx 32768 / max-kld 0.08 — must now return feasible plans with quality \"inherited (rule x, evidence y)\" or \"measured\", and must not select q4_0 KV under 0.08 if its quality is unknown/failing. Keep all existing tests passing; add tests for each rule and for fail-closed unknowns.\nAllowed writes: cc/moe_planner/**, artifacts/codexPL3/. 45 min, no Docker/GPU, nice. Final message: diff summary, ledger entries count by source, pytest, example plans for both scenarios.\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
